The numerical engines of TomoSTAR (eikonal solvers, ray tracing, LSQR, travel-time and attenuation
tomography, picking, t* measurement, location) derive from QUIVER (QUantitative Inversion of
Velocity, attEnuation and Relocation), by the same author, also released under the Apache License,
Version 2.0 (https://github.com/mattemangia/Quiver).

TomoSTAR uses third-party libraries under their own permissive licences; they are listed with
their copyright notices in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.
